-- =============================================================
-- Showcase organisation — Wrenfield Health (fictional), PRODUCTION-SAFE
--
-- An example hospital system in the live app, beside Blue Harbour and Lignum
-- Bank: three hospitals, their departments, the triage questions a patient
-- answers before joining (migration 038) and what to bring. Everything is
-- invented, including the two states it is in; its description says so.
--
-- Not included, which is why this may run on production when the demo script
-- may not: no logins or staff, no patients, no visits, no flags. Nothing
-- outside its own rows ("wf-biz-0001", "wf-br-*", "wf-svc-*" and their
-- children). INSERT IGNORE throughout, so a rerun never overwrites or deletes.
--
-- Lines are kept open and moving by the review simulator: add wf-biz-0001 to
-- REVIEW_SHOWCASE_IDS in .env. Exported from the organisation part of
-- apps/backend/scripts/seed-demo-healthcare.js (staging).
-- Needs migrations 038 (healthcare) and 040.
